  "Losing kitchens to the cheaper bid? Here's why.",
  "Say two contractors bid the same kitchen.",
  "You're at forty-two thousand. He's at thirty-six.",
  "Both send a PDF with a number on it.",
  "The homeowner can't picture either kitchen.",
  "So they compare the only thing they can see. The price.",
  "The cheaper number wins. Not the better job.",
  "Now say your bid came with their own kitchen, finished.",
  "Same room, after the remodel. They can look around it.",
  "Now they're not comparing numbers. They're picturing their kitchen.",
  "Our own remodeling company went from three in ten to five or six in ten.",
  "Your first tour is free. Link in bio."
